# EXPRESS-008 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:8  (starts with products p1 … p8)
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").

@host = http://localhost:3000

### First page, 5 per page (expect 200, p1 … p5, totalPages 2)
GET {{host}}/products

### Last page (expect 200, p6 p7 p8)
GET {{host}}/products?page=2

### Custom page size (expect 200, p4 p5 p6, totalPages 3)
GET {{host}}/products?page=2&pageSize=3

### After the last page (expect 200, empty data)
GET {{host}}/products?page=3

### Invalid page (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/products?page=0

### Page size too big (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/products?pageSize=51
